('item-65', 'usr-seller-1', 'cat-gadget', 'iPhone 15 Pro Max 256GB Natural Titanium Resmi iBox Mulus Like New', 'iphone-15-pro-max-256gb-natural-titanium-resmi-ibox', 'Dijual iPhone 15 Pro Max 256GB warna Natural Titanium garansi resmi iBox Indonesia (PA/A). Kondisi fisik 99% like new tanpa cacat atau dent, layar sudah terpasang tempered glass privacy. Battery Health 98% original awet seharian. Fitur Action Button, kamera periskop 5x optical zoom, dan port USB-C berfungsi normal. Fullset dus original, kabel type-c bawaan, dan nota pembelian resmi.', 17800000, 24999000, 1, 16900000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","WITH_RECEIPT"]', 2024, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 520, 12, 74, 'DKI Jakarta', 'Jakarta Selatan', 'Kebayoran Baru', '12130', 1, 'Gandaria City / Pacific Place SCBD', '{"storage":"256 GB","color":"Natural Titanium","batteryHealth":"98%","chipset":"Apple A17 Pro (3nm)","screen":"6.7 Super Retina XDR OLED 120Hz ProMotion"}', '2026-09-02T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-02T08:00:00Z'),
('item-66', 'usr-seller-9', 'cat-gadget', 'iPhone 15 128GB Black Resmi GDN Garansi Aktif Mulus 98%', 'iphone-15-128gb-black-resmi-gdn-garansi-aktif', 'iPhone 15 128GB warna Black garansi resmi Indonesia GDN aktif. Bodi mulus 98% pemakaian apik dengan case. Layar Dynamic Island cerah 2000 nits, kamera utama 48MP jernih dengan 2x telephoto crop. Battery Health 94% awet. Port USB-C lancar transfer data cepat. Fullset dus dan kabel original.', 11950000, 16499000, 1, 11200000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2024, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 430, 8, 52, 'Sumatera Utara', 'Medan', 'Medan Barat', '20111', 1, 'Sun Plaza Medan / Center Point', '{"storage":"128 GB","color":"Black","batteryHealth":"94%","chipset":"Apple A16 Bionic","screen":"6.1 Super Retina XDR with Dynamic Island"}', '2026-09-02T09:15:00Z', '2026-09-02T09:15:00Z'),
('item-67', 'usr-seller-2', 'cat-gadget', 'iPhone 13 128GB Midnight Garansi Resmi iBox Mulus Terawat', 'iphone-13-128gb-midnight-garansi-resmi-ibox', 'iPhone 13 kapasitas 128GB warna Midnight garansi resmi iBox. Kondisi mulus 95%, bezel aman no dent parah. Battery Health 86% normal pemakaian harian. Layar OLED Super Retina XDR jernih tanpa shadow. Face ID responsif, kamera Cinematic Mode tajam. Lengkap dus original dan kabel lightning to type-c.', 7650000, 12999000, 1, 7200000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 0, 'ACTIVE', 390, 9, 46, 'Jawa Barat', 'Bandung', 'Coblong', '40132', 1, 'Paris Van Java / Ciwalk Bandung', '{"storage":"128 GB","color":"Midnight","batteryHealth":"86%","chipset":"Apple A15 Bionic","screen":"6.1 Super Retina XDR OLED"}', '2026-09-02T10:30:00Z', '2026-09-02T10:30:00Z'),
('item-68', 'usr-seller-1', 'cat-gadget', 'iPhone 14 Plus 128GB Starlight Resmi iBox Baterai 92% Mulus', 'iphone-14-plus-128gb-starlight-resmi-ibox', 'iPhone 14 Plus 128GB warna Starlight garansi resmi iBox Indonesia. Layar besar 6.7 inci lega untuk nonton dan gaming dengan daya tahan baterai super awet. Battery Health 92% prima. Bodi samping aluminium aerospace-grade mulus 97%. Kamera Action Mode stabil untuk video. Fullset box original bawaan.', 10450000, 17999000, 1, 9800000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 480, 11, 61, 'DKI Jakarta', 'Jakarta Selatan', 'Cilandak', '12430', 1, 'Cilandak Town Square (CITOS) / Pondok Indah Mall', '{"storage":"128 GB","color":"Starlight","batteryHealth":"92%","chipset":"Apple A15 Bionic (5-Core GPU)","screen":"6.7 Super Retina XDR OLED"}', '2026-09-02T11:45:00Z', '2026-09-02T11:45:00Z'),
('item-69', 'usr-seller-3', 'cat-gadget', 'iPhone 12 Pro 256GB Pacific Blue Ex Inter All Operator Mulus 96%', 'iphone-12-pro-256gb-pacific-blue-ex-inter-mulus', 'iPhone 12 Pro internal besar 256GB warna Pacific Blue favorit. Fisik 96% terawat bodi stainless steel mengkilap. Sinyal all operator aman permanen (terdaftar IMEI Bea Cukai). Battery Health 85% normal belum pernah servis. Kamera telephoto 2x optical zoom dan sensor LiDAR tajam untuk foto low light. Unit dan dus.', 6850000, 16999000, 1, 6300000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["BOX_UNIT"]', 2022, NULL, 0, 'ACTIVE', 360, 7, 40, 'Jawa Timur', 'Surabaya', 'Gubeng', '60281', 1, 'Tunjungan Plaza / Grand City Surabaya', '{"storage":"256 GB","color":"Pacific Blue","batteryHealth":"85%","chipset":"Apple A14 Bionic","screen":"6.1 Super Retina XDR OLED","sensor":"LiDAR Scanner"}', '2026-09-02T13:00:00Z', '2026-09-02T13:00:00Z'),
('item-70', 'usr-seller-10', 'cat-gadget', 'Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra 5G 12GB / 256GB Titanium Gray SEIN Resmi Like New', 'samsung-galaxy-s24-ultra-5g-12gb-256gb-titanium-gray-sein', 'Flagship paling canggih Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra 5G 12GB/256GB warna Titanium Gray garansi resmi SEIN Indonesia. Fitur Galaxy AI lengkap (Circle to Search, Live Translate, Generative Edit). Layar Dynamic AMOLED 2X flat dengan kaca Corning Gorilla Armor anti pantulan cahaya. Bodi titanium tangguh, S-Pen mulus responsif, kamera 200MP + 50MP 5x optical zoom sangat jernih. Fullset original dus dan kabel.', 16500000, 21999000, 1, 15800000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","WITH_RECEIPT"]', 2024, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 690, 15, 95, 'Sulawesi Selatan', 'Makassar', 'Panakkukang', '90231', 1, 'Mall Panakkukang / Phinisi Point Makassar', '{"ram":"12 GB","storage":"256 GB","chipset":"Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 for Galaxy","display":"6.8 Dynamic AMOLED 2X 120Hz LTPO","camera":"200MP Quad Telephoto System with Galaxy AI","color":"Titanium Gray"}', '2026-09-02T14:15:00Z', '2026-09-02T14:15:00Z'),
('item-71', 'usr-seller-2', 'cat-gadget', 'Samsung Galaxy S24+ 5G 12GB / 256GB Cobalt Violet SEIN Mulus 98%', 'samsung-galaxy-s24-plus-5g-12gb-256gb-cobalt-violet-sein', 'Samsung Galaxy S24 Plus 5G RAM 12GB internal 256GB warna Cobalt Violet garansi resmi SEIN Indonesia. Desain one-mass estetik dengan bezel super tipis simetris. Layar QHD+ Dynamic AMOLED 2X 2600 nits memanjakan mata. Fitur Galaxy AI aktif, baterai besar 4900mAh tahan seharian. Fisik mulus 98% no minus. Fullset box kabel type-c bawaan pabrik.', 12200000, 16999000, 1, 11500000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2024, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 510, 10, 68, 'Jawa Barat', 'Bandung', 'Coblong', '40132', 1, 'Paris Van Java / Ciwalk Bandung', '{"ram":"12 GB","storage":"256 GB","chipset":"Exynos 2400 (4nm) with Ray Tracing","display":"6.7 QHD+ Dynamic AMOLED 2X 1-120Hz","battery":"4900 mAh with 45W Fast Charging","color":"Cobalt Violet"}', '2026-09-02T15:30:00Z', '2026-09-02T15:30:00Z'),
('item-72', 'usr-seller-3', 'cat-gadget', 'Samsung Galaxy Z Fold 5 5G 12GB / 512GB Icy Blue SEIN Garansi Aktif', 'samsung-galaxy-z-fold-5-5g-12gb-512gb-icy-blue-sein', 'HP lipat premium Samsung Galaxy Z Fold 5 5G 12GB RAM dan memori monster 512GB warna Icy Blue. Garansi resmi SEIN Indonesia masih aktif. Engsel Flex Hinge terbaru tertutup rapat tanpa celah. Layar lipat utama 7.6 inci no crease no scratch, layar cover 6.2 inci AMOLED 120Hz. Multitasking 3 aplikasi sekaligus sangat lancar. Fullset box original dan bonus case original standing strap.', 15900000, 26999000, 1, 14900000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","WITH_RECEIPT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 640, 14, 88, 'Jawa Timur', 'Surabaya', 'Gubeng', '60281', 1, 'Tunjungan Plaza / Grand City Surabaya', '{"ram":"12 GB","storage":"512 GB UFS 4.0","chipset":"Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 for Galaxy","display":"7.6 QXGA+ Dynamic AMOLED 2X Foldable + 6.2 Cover Screen","color":"Icy Blue","waterResistance":"IPX8 Water Resistant"}', '2026-09-02T16:45:00Z', '2026-09-02T16:45:00Z'),
('item-73', 'usr-seller-9', 'cat-gadget', 'Samsung Galaxy A55 5G 8GB / 256GB Awesome Iceblue Resmi SEIN Fullset Mulus', 'samsung-galaxy-a55-5g-8gb-256gb-awesome-iceblue-sein', 'Smartphone mid-range jawara Samsung Galaxy A55 5G 8GB/256GB warna Awesome Iceblue. Frame metal kokoh dan back cover kaca Gorilla Glass Victus+ elegan tahan banting dengan sertifikasi IP67 anti air/debu. Kamera utama 50MP OIS jernih foto malam hari berkat sensor Nightography. Layar Super AMOLED 120Hz 1000 nits. Baterai awet 5000mAh. Fullset box kabel data asli.', 4850000, 6899000, 1, 4500000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2024, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 460, 8, 57, 'Sumatera Utara', 'Medan', 'Medan Barat', '20111', 1, 'Sun Plaza Medan / Center Point Medan', '{"ram":"8 GB","storage":"256 GB with MicroSD slot up to 1TB","chipset":"Exynos 1480 (4nm) with AMD Xclipse 530 GPU","display":"6.6 FHD+ Super AMOLED 120Hz Vision Booster","color":"Awesome Iceblue"}', '2026-09-02T17:30:00Z', '2026-09-02T17:30:00Z'),
('item-74', 'usr-seller-1', 'cat-gadget', 'Samsung Galaxy S23 FE 5G 8GB / 128GB Mint Resmi SEIN Mulus 97%', 'samsung-galaxy-s23-fe-5g-8gb-128gb-mint-sein', 'Samsung Galaxy S23 Fan Edition (FE) 5G 8GB/128GB warna Mint segar garansi resmi SEIN Indonesia. Desain flagship ikonik Floating Camera dengan frame aluminium kuat. Kamera telephoto 3x optical zoom tajam, layar Dynamic AMOLED 2X 120Hz smooth. Speaker stereo Dolby Atmos jernih. Kondisi fisik 97% pemakaian harian terawat no minus fungsional. Fullset box original.', 6750000, 9999000, 1, 6200000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 0, 'ACTIVE', 390, 7, 48, 'DKI Jakarta', 'Jakarta Selatan', 'Kebayoran Baru', '12130', 1, 'Gandaria City / Blok M Plaza', '{"ram":"8 GB","storage":"128 GB","chipset":"Exynos 2200 (4nm)","display":"6.4 FHD+ Dynamic AMOLED 2X 120Hz","color":"Mint","waterResistance":"IP68 Water and Dust Resistant"}', '2026-09-02T18:45:00Z', '2026-09-02T18:45:00Z');

